    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Enter the depths. Extract the unknown. Survive the protocol.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the aftermath of World War II, a secretive research division developed Substance D-185, a powerful experimental compound. A vast underground facility was constructed for its production\u2014isolated, controlled, and hidden from the world above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But containment failed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A breach beneath the facility allowed the compound to leak into the earth, mutating organic life and warping the very minerals it touched. What followed was the creation of Neolite\u2014a volatile, glowing element rich in energy, and dangerously unstable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, decades later, you are the operator of a specialized deep-core drill, engineered to withstand exposure to D-185. Your mission is simple:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extract Neolite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Record all anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And return alive\u2014if you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tunnels are toxic, the air unbreathable, and the corruption spreads deeper with each cycle. You must never leave the drill. Non-compliance will trigger full protocol reset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neolite is the future. But something else is down there\u2014and it's watching.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Enter the depths. Extract the unknown. Survive the protocol.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the aftermath of World War II, a secretive research division developed Substance D-185, a powerful experimental compound. A vast underground facility was constructed for its production\u2014isolated, controlled, and hidden from the world above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But containment failed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A breach beneath the facility allowed the compound to leak into the earth, mutating organic life and warping the very minerals it touched. What followed was the creation of Neolite\u2014a volatile, glowing element rich in energy, and dangerously unstable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, decades later, you are the operator of a specialized deep-core drill, engineered to withstand exposure to D-185. Your mission is simple:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extract Neolite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Record all anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And return alive\u2014if you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tunnels are toxic, the air unbreathable, and the corruption spreads deeper with each cycle. You must never leave the drill. Non-compliance will trigger full protocol reset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neolite is the future. But something else is down there\u2014and it's watching.</p>",
    "short_description": "You\u2019re operating a drill machine beneath an abandoned chemical lab. You\u2019ll feel the ground tremble, hear faint whispers in the dark, and glimpse shadows just beyond your lights. Stay focused\u2014ignore what you see and hear\u2014and keep drilling until your tasks are done.",
